@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<style>
    body {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0ea5e9 0%, #06b6d4 100%);
        min-height: 100vh;
    }

    .privacy-container {
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 50px auto;
        background: white;
        border-radius: 20px;
        box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
        padding: 50px;
    }

    .privacy-header {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
        padding-bottom: 25px;
        border-bottom: 3px solid #0ea5e9;
    }

        .privacy-header h1 {
            color: #0f172a;
            font-size: 38px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .privacy-header p {
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

    .privacy-section {
        margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

        .privacy-section h2 {
            color: #0ea5e9;
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .privacy-section h3 {
            color: #334155;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-top: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .privacy-section p {
            color: #475569;
            line-height: 1.9;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            text-align: justify;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        .privacy-section ul {
            margin-left: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .privacy-section li {
            color: #475569;
            line-height: 1.9;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

    .highlight-box {
        background: #f0f9ff;
        border-left: 5px solid #0ea5e9;
        padding: 25px;
        margin: 30px 0;
        border-radius: 8px;
    }

        .highlight-box h3 {
            color: #0369a1;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .highlight-box p {
            color: #0c4a6e;
            margin: 0;
            font-weight: 500;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .highlight-box ul {
            margin-top: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .highlight-box li {
            color: #0c4a6e;
        }

    .warning-box {
        background: #fef3c7;
        border-left: 5px solid #f59e0b;
        padding: 25px;
        margin: 30px 0;
        border-radius: 8px;
    }

        .warning-box h3 {
            color: #92400e;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .warning-box p {
            color: #78350f;
            margin: 0;
            font-weight: 500;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

    .icon {
        font-size: 26px;
    }

    .contact-section {
        background: #f8fafc;
        border: 2px solid #e2e8f0;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 30px;
        margin-top: 40px;
        text-align: center;
    }

        .contact-section h3 {
            color: #0f172a;
            font-size: 22px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .contact-section p {
            color: #64748b;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .contact-section a {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #0ea5e9;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: background 0.3s ease;
        }

            .contact-section a:hover {
                background: #0284c7;
            }
</style>

<div class="privacy-container">
    <div class="privacy-header">
        <h1><span>🎓</span> Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>Last Updated: May 20, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
        <h2><span class="icon">📋</span> Introduction</h2>
        <p>
            Welcome to EduCert Automated Certificate Generator. We understand the importance of data privacy
            and security when handling student information and educational records. This Privacy Policy explains
            how our application processes certificate templates and student database information during the
            certificate generation process.
        </p>
        <p>
            Our application is designed as a document processing tool that helps educational institutions generate
            professional certificates by merging Word document templates with student database records. We are
            committed to maintaining the highest standards of data security and privacy.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
        <h2><span class="icon">🔒</span> Information We Process</h2>
        <p>When you use our certificate generation service, we temporarily process the following information:</p>

        <h3>Certificate Templates</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>Word document templates (.doc, .docx, .md, .txt, .docm, .dotm, .rtf, .html)</li>
            <li>Certificate templates containing merge fields for student information</li>
            <li>Custom educational document formats</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Student Database Files</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>SQLite database files (.db, .sqlite, .sqlite3) containing student records</li>
            <li>Structured data including student demographics, course information, grades, and instructor details</li>
            <li>Multiple tables with relational database structures</li>
            <li>Database relationship configurations for nested data processing</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Digital Signature Assets</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>Optional signature image files (.png, .jpg, .jpeg, .gif, .bmp)</li>
            <li>Signature placement keywords (Principal, Director, Sign, etc.)</li>
            <li>Digital certificate files for PDF signature authentication</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Generated Certificates</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>Individual or batch PDF certificates with student-specific information</li>
            <li>Single consolidated PDF or multiple individual certificates in ZIP format</li>
            <li>Digitally signed certificates with authorized signatory placement</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
        <h2><span class="icon">⚙️</span> How We Process Your Data</h2>
        <p>
            Our application uses Syncfusion DocIO library to perform mail merge operations and document conversion.
            The processing workflow is as follows:
        </p>

        <h3>Document Processing Steps:</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Upload:</strong> Your certificate template and SQLite database file are uploaded to the server's temporary memory</li>
            <li><strong>Database Connection:</strong> The system establishes a secure connection to the SQLite database and dynamically discovers all tables</li>
            <li><strong>Relationship Parsing:</strong> Database table relationships are parsed based on your configuration (parent-child table linkages)</li>
            <li><strong>Mail Merge Execution:</strong> Syncfusion DocIO performs intelligent mail merge - simple merge for single tables, nested group merge for relational databases</li>
            <li><strong>PDF Conversion:</strong> The merged document is converted to PDF format using Syncfusion DocIORenderer</li>
            <li><strong>Digital Signature Application:</strong> If enabled, authorized signatures are automatically placed above specified keywords in the certificate</li>
            <li><strong>Certificate Generation:</strong> Based on your selection, either a single certificate or batch certificates (split by page breaks) are created</li>
            <li><strong>ZIP Packaging:</strong> For batch processing, individual certificates are packaged into a compressed ZIP file</li>
            <li><strong>Download:</strong> The generated certificate(s) are immediately sent to your browser for download</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="warning-box">
        <h3><span>⚠️</span> Important Note</h3>
        <p>
            All processing happens locally in your browser, and files <strong>never</strong>
            go to any external server. Everything stays private and secure on your machine. ✔️
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-section">
        <h3>📧 Questions or Concerns?</h3>
        <p>
            If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or how we handle certificate generation and
            database processing, please contact Syncfusion support for technical assistance:
        </p>
        <a href="https://support.syncfusion.com/support/tickets/create" target="_blank">
            Contact Syncfusion Support
        </a>
    </div>
</div>